# Player car 2, first sheet. PDF page 15, block H.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip L1 7408
chip L2 74112
chip Q1 7410
chip Q2 74193
chip D1 7486
chip A1 7404
chip K1 7420
chip M2 74112
chip H2 7408
# K2.7 label partly unclear; physical continuity is unambiguous.
# Fixed 2026-11-05: K2.12 meets the 5GTHB/5HTHB line feeding GRSC/HRSC. Death Race 5U/5H agree. J and K are then complementary.
chip K2 74112
chip G1 7407
chip M1 7400
chip P1 74193
prom N1 82S129 92
chip N2 7407
prom R1 82S123 35
chip P2 74161
chip A2 74161
chip A3 74161

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net HTWS L1.3 L2.3
net NTTB L1.1 BOARD
net NTTA L1.2 BOARD
net HTWR L1.6 L2.2
net 5NTTB L1.4
net 5NTTA L1.5
net 2PQ07 L2.1 L2.13 M2.1
net H999 L2.4 L2.10 L2.14 M2.15 M2.10 M2.14 K2.10 K2.14 P1.10 P1.9 A2.1 A2.5 A2.6 A2.10 A3.1 A3.5 A3.6 A3.10 BOARD
net HTWA L2.5 L2.11 Q1.5 Q1.9
net 5HTWA L2.6 L2.12
net 1ESGC L2.15 P2.1
net NC L2.9 Q2.13 Q2.12 K2.9 P1.13 P1.12 P2.11 P2.12 P2.13 P2.14 A2.11 A2.12 A2.13 A2.14 A3.11 A3.12 A3.13 A3.14
